We use the previously accepted faithful model of the original ambient group
$G=G_2(11)$ in $\GL_7(\mathbb F_{11})$, its catalogue of markings, and its
orbit and transporter data. These are borrowed inputs. In particular, the
ambient inequality $|G|>11^6=1{,}771{,}561$ is a stated input of the existing
